{%- comment -%}
  gift-card-recipient — 礼品卡商品的「寄给收件人」字段（合规项 G-09）。

  平台契约（**字段名一个字都不能改，拼错就是静默不生效**）：
    properties[__shopify_send_gift_card_to_recipient]  开关。隐藏域 value="if_present"
                                                       是无 JS 时的口径；有 JS 时该隐藏域被禁用，
                                                       由复选框自己提交
    properties[__shopify_offset]                       收件人时区偏移（分钟），脚本填
    properties[Recipient email]                        收件人邮箱
    properties[Recipient name]                         收件人姓名
    properties[Message]                                留言（≤200 字符）
    properties[Send on]                                寄送日期（YYYY-MM-DD）

  下方 `form.*` 一律是出错重提交时的回填值（服务端回传），不是主题自己算的。
  注意寄送日期的回填走 `form.send_on`（平台在商品表单里给的键），
  `gift_card.send_on` 是礼品卡对象上的同名属性、只在 gift_card 页与通知模板里可用。

  参数：product / form / section
{%- endcomment -%}

<gift-card-recipient class="gift-recipient" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
  {%- comment -%}
    复选框出厂 disabled：无 JS 时不提交，由隐藏域 if_present 兜底；脚本一上来把它打开。
    用 visually-hidden 而非 display:none —— 保留键盘可达与读屏可读，焦点环画在 label 上。
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <input
    type="checkbox"
    class="gift-recipient__checkbox visually-hidden"
    id="Recipient-checkbox-{{ section.id }}"
    name="properties[__shopify_send_gift_card_to_recipient]"
    {% if form.email != blank %}
      checked
    {% endif %}
    disabled
  >
  <label class="gift-recipient__toggle" for="Recipient-checkbox-{{ section.id }}">
    <span class="gift-recipient__tick" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="gift-recipient__toggle-text">{{ 'gift_card_recipient.toggle' | t }}</span>
  </label>

  <div class="gift-recipient__fields" data-recipient-fields>
    <div class="gift-recipient__field">
      <label class="gift-recipient__label" for="Recipient-email-{{ section.id }}">
        {{- 'gift_card_recipient.email_label' | t -}}
      </label>
      <input
        class="gift-recipient__input"
        type="email"
        id="Recipient-email-{{ section.id }}"
        name="properties[Recipient email]"
        value="{{ form.email }}"
        autocomplete="email"
        placeholder="{{ 'gift_card_recipient.email_placeholder' | t }}"
        required
      >
    </div>

    <div class="gift-recipient__field">
      <label class="gift-recipient__label" for="Recipient-name-{{ section.id }}">
        {{- 'gift_card_recipient.name_label' | t -}}
      </label>
      <input
        class="gift-recipient__input"
        type="text"
        id="Recipient-name-{{ section.id }}"
        name="properties[Recipient name]"
        value="{{ form.name }}"
        autocomplete="name"
        placeholder="{{ 'gift_card_recipient.name_placeholder' | t }}"
      >
    </div>

    <div class="gift-recipient__field">
      <label class="gift-recipient__label" for="Recipient-message-{{ section.id }}">
        {{- 'gift_card_recipient.message_label' | t -}}
      </label>
      <textarea
        class="gift-recipient__input gift-recipient__textarea"
        id="Recipient-message-{{ section.id }}"
        name="properties[Message]"
        rows="3"
        maxlength="200"
        placeholder="{{ 'gift_card_recipient.message_placeholder' | t }}"
      >{{ form.message }}</textarea>
      <p class="gift-recipient__hint">{{ 'gift_card_recipient.message_hint' | t: count: 200 }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="gift-recipient__field">
      <label class="gift-recipient__label" for="Recipient-send-on-{{ section.id }}">
        {{- 'gift_card_recipient.send_on_label' | t -}}
      </label>
      <input
        class="gift-recipient__input"
        type="date"
        id="Recipient-send-on-{{ section.id }}"
        name="properties[Send on]"
        value="{{ form.send_on }}"
        min="{{ 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}"
      >
      <p class="gift-recipient__hint">{{ 'gift_card_recipient.send_on_hint' | t }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    隐藏域放在字段之后：无 JS 时它随表单一并提交（if_present = "有收件人信息才寄给收件人"）。
    有 JS 时脚本会把它禁用，改由复选框的 checked 决定，避免出现两个同名值。
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <input
    type="hidden"
    name="properties[__shopify_send_gift_card_to_recipient]"
    value="if_present"
    data-recipient-control
  >
  <input type="hidden" name="properties[__shopify_offset]" value="" data-recipient-offset disabled>
</gift-card-recipient>
